WEBVTT

00:00:03.484 --> 00:00:06.490
Test every change before it goes live.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.070
Start with real answers your customers rated.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.560
Test with up to 100 question-and-answer pairs,

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.050
with more on the roadmap.

00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:16.332
Then make Publish wait for

00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:18.002
a passing test set.

00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:21.164
A teammate edits the draft.

00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:23.084
Compare asks recent questions on

00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:24.314
Live and on the draft,

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.714
and flags the one answer that changed:

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.494
Saturday now opens at ten,

00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:29.364
not eight.

00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:34.116
Score the draft against the test set.

00:00:34.136 --> 00:00:36.586
It fails at eighty-seven point five percent,

00:00:36.606 --> 00:00:38.356
so Publish stays locked.

00:00:39.193 --> 00:00:40.673
Fix the hours, save,

00:00:40.693 --> 00:00:42.573
and run the test set again.

00:00:46.528 --> 00:00:47.858
One hundred percent.

00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:49.508
Now Publish goes through.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:55.717
Cuttlely. The open-source agent platform for applications.

